# What a probabilistic zonotope means beyond its laws

`gZonotopeLaw` is the law of a G-zonotope with certain mean, `c + G N`; `gaussPdf` the Gaussian
density, with its standard case and a printed variant that is not one; `eph` the enclosing
probabilistic hull, the supremum of the densities over the possible means.
-/
